(Bug #73: the mis-tag was a memory-safety fault, not only a wrong answer.
 The correct call above leaves the Text tag in rsi; the swallowed call
 never overwrote it, so the integer 42 arrived tagged Text and `Print`
 dereferenced 42 as a text pointer - a deterministic segfault. Register
 #43 is the same shape reached by a different route.)

